            <title>[IGNITE-1378] Continuous processor doesn&apos;t remove message listener if continuous query failed to start</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1378</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridContinuousProcessor.startRoutine(..)&lt;/tt&gt; method adds message listener on line 538 and never removes it if handler registration fails (e.g., due to marshalling issues). Need to fix exception handling in this method.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
